apdustudio-script 1
# A script for the demo card: start ApduStudio with --demo, then open this file.
atr: 3B 88 80 01 00 00 00 00 77 81 80 00 7F

step: Select the master file
card: 00 A4 00 00 02 3F 00
expect: 90 00

step: Select the application
card: 00 A4 04 00 07 A0 00 00 00 04 10 10
expect: 6F ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? 90 00

step: Get challenge (8 random bytes)
card: 00 84 00 00 08
expect: ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? ?? 90 00

step: Read record 1, SFI 1
card: 00 B2 01 0C 00
expect: 90 00

step: Get data: ATC
card: 80 CA 9F 36 00
expect: 61 *

step: Verify PIN (template: fill in the PIN)
card: 00 20 00 80 04 <PIN, 4 bytes>
expect: 90 00
